    {
      "target": "Strings/Characters",
      "key": "AbigailInMineFirst",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, @. Surprised? ...I finally found the courage to come down here.#$b#I felt scared at first, but I pushed through.#$b#I feel much more confident now. This is actually really fun!$h",
